Relian-Hyprland
===============

Relian-Hyprland is a modified version of "Hyprland-Dots" by JaKooLit
(https://github.com/JaKooLit/Hyprland-Dots), distributed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 (see LICENSE.md). It is free software and comes with NO WARRANTY.

Changes made in this version (GPL-3.0 section 5(a) notice of modification):
  - Hyprland configuration converted from hyprlang (.conf) to Lua (Hyprland >= 0.55)
  - Omarchy-style Waybar layout and style, rofi launcher and menus, theme carousel,
    AI-agent usage icon, searchable help menu, notification/terminal styling
  - Screensaver (terminal text effects over ASCII logo art) and a minimal SDDM login theme, adapted from Omarchy (below)
  - Project renamed and rebranded; the multi-distro installers replaced by a single install.sh; tests added (tests/run.sh)

